This game has been full of oddities... just an unusual concentration of
them:

Playing a priest, began with spellbooks of identify and extra healing(!!)
... on dungeon level 2, I found an altar, and four steps from it was an
icebox containing a dozen corpses.  I halfway expected Frost Brand to appear
after sacrificing all the corpses, but nothing happened.  Ah well..  Did i
mention that my starting dexterity was, umm, six?  I don't remember ever
seeing a starting dexterity of six, or maybe I've just forgotten.

Playing with unusual caution, I press on and find a shield of reflection in
the mines, along with a luckstone just below Minetown.  I encounter a
leocrotta and flee back up to the main dungeon.  I obtain Mjollnir from the
altar, and then soon thereafter find a wand of polymorph... polypile up nine
scrolls of enchant armor, and now I'm at AC -8 with no body armor as yet.  I
did Sokoban (got the amulet of reflection, polypiled it but it
evaporated)... but Sokoban quite usefully yielded a co-aligned unicorn, and
I had identified all my gems of course, and blessed the luckstone...

Just found the -5 (!) cursed Cleaver lying on dungeon level 8...

*Very* weird game.



